  "description": "Subvert HT5 Plus is a natural at diving into turns and mastering rocky terrain. HT5 features a 6000 series alloy 27.5\" Plus geometry frame with a tapered head tube. Its ultra cushy ride comes courtesy of its Rockshox Recon Silver RS 29\" Boost fork with 120mm of travel combined with WTB Scraper 27.5: Plus i35 rims w/TCS tape and are tubeless ready, and iced with Kenda Havoc 27.5 x 2.8\" 120tpi tires. A semi complete Shimano SLX 7000 1X11 Shadow Plus drive train partnering with an FSA Comet Modular Boost crankset with a 30t chain ring keeps shifting smooth, fast, and efficient.\n6061-T6 alloy Hardtail frame, 27.5\" Plus geometry, tapered head tube, 73mm BB shell, Boost thru-axle dropouts\nNew Rockshox Recon Silver RS 29\" Boost fork, 120mm travel, tapered\nFSA Comet Modular Boost crankset, 30T Crmo Chainring\nShimano SLX 7000 1x11-spd Shadow Plus rear derailleur & shifter\nShimano SLX 7000 11-46T cassette\nWTB Scraper 27.5\" Plus i35 rims w/ TCS tape, Tubeless ready\nKenda Havoc 27.5x2.8\" tires, TCS, Aramid beads, 120 tpi\nShimano BR-M395 Hydraulic disc brakeset",
